    "title": "Virginia vs Tennessee schedule, TV channel, how to watch March Madness",
    "text": "Updated March 21, 2026, 2:30 p.m. MTNo. 3 seed Virginia and No. 6 seed Tennessee play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Sunday, March 22.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the Midwest Region March Madness second-round game.Virginia defeated No. 14 seed Wright State in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 82-73.Tennessee beat No. 11 seed Miami (Ohio) in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 78-56.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Purdue vs Miami | Iowa State vs Kentucky | Kansas vs St. John's | Virginia vs Tennessee | Florida vs Iowa | Arizona vs Utah State | UConn vs UCLA | Alabama vs Texas Tech | Second-round game schedule, TV channels | AnnouncersWatch Virginia vs Tennessee on Sling TVWhat time is the Tennessee vs Virginia March Madness game?The Virginia vs Tennessee NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 3:10 p.m. MST on Sunday, March 22.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Virginia vs Tennessee March Madness game on?The Tennessee vs Virginia Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on TNT.March Madness picks: Purdue vs Miami | Iowa State vs Kentucky | Kansas vs St. John's | Virginia vs Tennessee | Florida vs Iowa | Arizona vs Utah State | UConn vs UCLA | Alabama vs Texas Tech | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the Tennessee vs Virginia March Madness game?Virginia vs Tennessee can be streamed on Sling TV and other streaming services that carry TNT.Who are the announcers for the Virginia vs Tennessee March Madness game?Andrew Catalon will have the play-by-play call of the Tennessee Volunteers vs Virginia Cavaliers NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Steve Lappas as the analyst and Evan Washburn as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Purdue vs Miami | Iowa State vs Kentucky | Kansas vs St. John's | Virginia vs Tennessee | Florida vs Iowa | Arizona vs Utah State | UConn vs UCLA | Alabama vs Texas Tech | Second-round game odds | Title oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
